Description:It is your first main phase. You have three energy counters and Harnessed Lightning (you get three energy, then pay any amount of energy to deal that much damage to target creature) in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Colossal Dreadmaw (6/6). Destroy the Dreadmaw this turn.
